🧠 **SUGGESTION: this test re-builds the whole harness inline (~45 lines of duplicated stubs)**

`config.scm.jenkinsBasePath is handed to the failed-checks probe` cannot use `makeActionHarness` because the harness `config` has no `scm` block — but instead of extending the harness, the test duplicates the entire `makeRequire` graph (configLoader, gh, gitOps, trackers, setupCommands, baseBranchMarker, config.js stubs) inline. Two copies of the same stub graph will drift: when a new module lands in `preCliReworkSetup.js`'s require list, this test breaks independently of the harness.

Cheaper seam — parameterize the harness config instead:

